#: ../../desktop/index.rst:3
msgid "Desktop Clients"
msgstr "Skrivebordsklienter"

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"Available for Windows, macOS, and various Linux distributions, the Nextcloud"
" Desktop Sync client enables you to:"
msgstr ""
"Nextclouds skrivebordsklient til synkronisering findes til Windows, macOS og"
" forskellige Linux-distributioner. Med den kan du:"

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Specify one or more directories on your computer that you want to "
"synchronize to the Nextcloud server."
msgstr ""
"Angive en eller flere mapper på din computer, som du vil synkronisere med "
"Nextcloud-serveren."

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:10
msgid "Always have the latest files synchronized, wherever they are located."
msgstr "Altid have de nyeste filer synkroniseret, uanset hvor de ligger."

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"Your files are always automatically synchronized between your Nextcloud "
"server, computer and mobile device."
msgstr ""
"Dine filer synkroniseres altid automatisk mellem din Nextcloud-server, din "
"computer og din mobilenhed."

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:26
msgid "You can find additional information here:"
msgstr "Du kan finde flere oplysninger her:"

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:28
msgid "`Admin manual`_"
msgstr "`Admin manual`_"

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:29
msgid "`Developer manual`_"
msgstr "`Developer manual`_"
